ont-size: 21px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <div class=\"masthead\">\n    <h1 class=\"logotype\">sc<span class=\"tube-i\">i</span><span class=\"tilde\">~</span><span class=\"a-red\">a</span>rt</h1>\n    <div class=\"strapline\">Call for ideas from partnerships in science and art</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"middle\">\n    <div class=\"question\">\n      Can you bring the insights of science<br>\n      and art closer together with an idea<br>\n      that captures the public&rsquo;s imagination?\n    </div>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder artwork\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n      [Photograph: centre-right — red artist&rsquo;s palette lying flat with five glass test tubes filled with purple liquid standing upright through it]\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"col col-1\">\n      The Wellcome Centre is providing funds for developing the ideas of scientists and artists working in partnership. Three to six ideas may be funded with amounts ranging from &pound;5000 to &pound;50&thinsp;000.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col col-2\">\n      Scientists and artists with an active interest in the subjects of biology, medicine and health (including mental health) are invited to submit their ideas to SCI~ART.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col col-3\">\n      <p>For details of how to enter SCI~ART see reverse, or call 0171 611 8289. The closing date for entries is 14 February 1997</p>\n      <p>The Wellcome Trust is a<br>registered charity, no. 210183</p>\n      <div class=\"placeholder trust-logo\">[Logo: THE WELLCOME TRUST roundel]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottombar\">\n    <div class=\"bar-left\">THE WELLCOME CENTRE FOR MEDICAL SCIENCE</div>\n    <div class=\"bar-right\">helping medical science to flourish</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
